# Hi 👋 I'm Kath

## I’m a BS Computer Science student focused on automation ⚙️, artificial intelligence 🤖, and cybersecurity 🛡️.

I build and study systems around automation workflows, AI-assisted applications, and defensive security practices. My cybersecurity focus is on SOC analyst–ready skills such as log analysis 📊, network monitoring 🌐, incident detection 🚨, Linux administration 🐧, and understanding attacker behavior from a defensive standpoint.

Currently, I’m developing “Mathiva” 📱, an AI-powered learning application that uses OCR, machine learning, and retrieval-based techniques to solve and explain math problems.

I’m continuously developing my skills through hands-on projects, security labs 🧪, and practical exploration in AI systems, automation, and cybersecurity operations.
